  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). The Slagborn firecaller who rules the buried half of Cinderholt and collects an ash-tithe from the living half. He calls ash down on everyone not standing under his canopy — STAND NEXT TO HIM — writes a writ on the farthest player (a following circle) and brings his gavel down in a line. At 60% his raiders come. At 30% he burns the writs: burning circles on everyone and a get-in-close ring.",
  "party": "Open world elite. Solo: tough — the verdict punishes running away. 2-3: intended. 5+: quick. M5 scaling: health by players tagged; raiders 2 -> 3 at five.",
