      "'Your tithe is late.'",
      "The Ashen Reeve unrolls a scroll of grey ash. Your name is on it."
    ],
    "death": "The Ashen Reeve's scroll catches fire in his hand. He crumbles with it.",
    "reset": "The Ashen Reeve goes back to his ledger."
  },
